{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Queen is cruel. The court is corrupt. And the goblin in the dungeon? He\u2019s about to flip the castle upside-down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740830/extras/09d69715c70871c204efac0828d64110.avif?t=1768622526\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Court of Chaos is a short, adult visual novel that trades sprawling storylines for pure, escalating humiliation. Play as Briggs, a lowly goblin with a grudge, who teams up with the queen's bitter court to unravel the Queen\u2019s dignity \u2014 one prank, hex, and &quot;wardrobe malfunction&quot; at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740830/extras/33aa4a30d420690dfef66b402367058f.avif?t=1768622526\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This isn\u2019t a grand fantasy epic. It\u2019s a focused, filthy ride built around:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lewd pranks that get progressively more humiliating and degrading</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Public corruption of a powerful tyrant queen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >    Magical sabotage, transparent tops, cursed speeches, and more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740830/extras/b98aabffcdf9b81a05efcdcc68bef430.avif?t=1768622526\" width=1000 height=562 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build chaos. Raise suspicion and manipulate until the Queen is left flustered, exposed, and begging for control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You\u2019re not here to save the kingdom. You\u2019re here to make her squirm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740830/extras/a2b27af4c7bff7e3c227f5060dc023d3.avif?t=1768622526\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Oh, and don't forget about your devout prisoner in the dungeon...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740830/extras/9166654f35e988d76444d1724375ff87.poster.avif?t=1768622526\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740830/extras/9166654f35e988d76444d1724375ff87.webm?t=1768622526\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Stupid Sexy Queen...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740830/062c051a42e53efa5fbbdfb6d511c1f17b706d50.jpg"},{"name":"The Queen is Not in Control ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740830/1a0bb64783eb60bdafe618fb085472abff084227.jpg"},{"name":"Coupe De Grace!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740830/8eb56cdbf20a5c5c20674ff57b89936599d87848.jpg"},{"name":"But Shes a Priestess! ","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740830/2551d197f45a95523aba5ae45516edf6d6905f2c.jpg"},{"name":"The Queen Will Kneel!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740830/0f5ddb87e53b98e4121d07c762f16bfae627aebd.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou